<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:41:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Prime Minister Modi declared the Bastar district in Chhattisgarh Naxal free while warning that &amp;quot;dimagi&amp;quot; Naxals have infiltrated political parties and organisations. In Manipur, Chief Minister Khemchand Singh met the families of two Kuki youths killed in Kangpokli and said the case was transferred to the NIA, and Home Minister Govindas Konthoujam pledged safe return of displaced persons. Over 4,000 firearms were recovered in Manipur, raising fresh security concerns, and the state census remains suspended until April 2027 following a high court order. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to its data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Excelsior&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE9WSTlFYV9Cc3N3dVBGUEpvM0Rqakp0bnFZWVFEdlk0MTdjcTVDMU9KX2FLM0RBRkcweUx6OVpJamJtUmxjVVByRF82UHEwR2U0MVNETm5fenhuRzAwNXRTRjlkN1NpVHhjQ0w1WG1WN1hMQjJoUkxZWEpzME8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Brighter Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPcWFjazdaLW1vOWNROGdudEx1MTY3eTlVRjNZZ3RYYnVqTkNTSWZHekIzenBZUi0xZ1l5X0ROdGVSUGRkc1RZdVpFSEtQMDVnVjY5Vk96UFZqZncwSmZJRDJQMW5yQThNQ3BGbHFEd1pHTzdtT3dETG1iazVZVnJYMFkzbmhTRW1IOXpHYlpQYWhZYjhBYW1mdmx6Wk4xZ2Rm?oc=5&quot;&gt;News On AIR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPWkZuTm5Fa1M5QmlCdlhwNGgwbU1iLW5NQmlvYlpQcjVlMkg3M1FMMWlBVURvVkg2M2MwQjVHTHZRYmwwUm9paVQ5cUwwV3BQOTAwSnN0eFVXN241ZXA0NnJLZXhMWkVibWJtSTdWSF92MmVLcFFLNTEzRTdLNlRGVi1DZHFKd2Fac0R3M0hKb0VBUk9rQnBSRThYYzh2OEpLRExoRDVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Reader&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&qu